# Raw source downloads are versioned by directory name (source/date), not by
# git: they run to several megabytes and change wholesale when a source
# republishes. What belongs in the repository is the *normalised* comparison
# dataset and the analysis derived from it, both of which are small and
# reviewable.
#
# `pnpm catalogue:fetch` recreates anything here from the recorded URLs.
*/
!.gitignore
